{:edb/committed true :edb/basis-t 366 :edb/replayed false :edb/tx-hash "f0f56170d02d86602192fe96fc97c991c0214e4e2f49faac68db11e66fac3a24" :edb/db-before-t 365 :edb/db-after-t 366 :edb/tx-data [[13194139533678 50 #inst "2026-10-04T10:49:40.532Z" 13194139533678 true] [17592186094070 1000 #edb/ref 17592186246208 13194139533678 true] [17592186096541 1020 #edb/ref 17592186246216 13194139533678 true] [17592186096541 1020 #edb/ref 17592186246219 13194139533678 true] [17592186096541 1020 #edb/ref 17592186246222 13194139533678 true] [17592186096541 1020 #edb/ref 17592186246226 13194139533678 true] [17592186096542 1020 #edb/ref 17592186246230 13194139533678 true] [17592186096542 1020 #edb/ref 17592186246233 13194139533678 true] [17592186096542 1020 #edb/ref 17592186246236 13194139533678 true] [17592186096542 1020 #edb/ref 17592186246252 13194139533678 true] [17592186096542 1020 #edb/ref 17592186246259 13194139533678 true] [17592186096543 1020 #edb/ref 17592186246209 13194139533678 true] [17592186096543 1020 #edb/ref 17592186246239 13194139533678 true] [17592186096543 1020 #edb/ref 17592186246243 13194139533678 true] [17592186096543 1020 #edb/ref 17592186246246 13194139533678 true] [17592186096543 1020 #edb/ref 17592186246249 13194139533678 true] [17592186096944 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139533678 true] [17592186096944 1145 "The numerator and denominator are $u(x)=-2$ and $v(x)=4x-9,$ respectively. Their derivatives are given by\n\n \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{u}^{′}(x) & =0, \\\\ {v}^{′}(x) & =4.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nApplying the quotient rule, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{{u}^{′}(x)\\cdot v(x)-u(x){v}^{′}(x)}{[v(x)]^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{(0)\\cdot (4x-9)-(-2)\\cdot (4)}{{(4x-9)}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{8}{{(4x-9)}^{2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246208 1034 "-\\frac{4}{{(4x-9)}^{2}}" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246208 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533678 true] [17592186246208 1111 #uuid "19f23363-bfb1-59af-bb57-febf515ba106" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246209 1017 #edb/ref 17592186246210 13194139533678 true] [17592186246209 1089 "q-11969" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246209 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139533678 true] [17592186246209 1100 "Given that $y=\\frac{-x}{9-2x}$, find $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}.$" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246209 1113 #uuid "4c943def-8bb8-53a4-bbd8-db085bf164ee" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246209 1138 false 13194139533678 true] [17592186246209 1145 "Let $u=-x$ and $v=9-2x.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x} & =-1\\,\\text{and}\\,\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=-2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the quotient rule, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{v\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}-u\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}}{{v}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{(9-2x)\\cdot (-1)-(-x)\\cdot (-2)}{{(9-2x)}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{-9+2x-2x}{{(9-2x)}^{2}} \\\\  & =-\\frac{9}{{(9-2x)}^{2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246210 1000 #edb/ref 17592186246211 13194139533678 true] [17592186246210 1000 #edb/ref 17592186246212 13194139533678 true] [17592186246210 1000 #edb/ref 17592186246213 13194139533678 true] [17592186246210 1000 #edb/ref 17592186246214 13194139533678 true] [17592186246210 1000 #edb/ref 17592186246215 13194139533678 true] [17592186246210 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533678 true] [17592186246210 1041 "selection" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246210 1104 #edb/ref 17592186246213 13194139533678 true] [17592186246210 1110 #uuid "ca8eecf0-cb60-5559-8d94-2aec89d8659f" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246211 1034 "\\frac{4x-9}{{(9-2x)}^{2}}" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246211 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533678 true] [17592186246211 1111 #uuid "544d7fd2-d7d4-5086-b631-fc0075a36068" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246212 1034 "\\frac{9}{{(9-2x)}^{2}}" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246212 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533678 true] [17592186246212 1111 #uuid "2ef14ca3-6a32-53cf-aef5-0656754dd075" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246213 1034 "-\\frac{9}{{(9-2x)}^{2}}" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246213 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533678 true] [17592186246213 1111 #uuid "d37bcade-6db8-554c-bff8-84992a8cecfc" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246214 1034 "-\\frac{4x-9}{{(9-2x)}^{2}}" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246214 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533678 true] [17592186246214 1111 #uuid "0ca29b98-cef7-552e-9c70-a420c89afdcc" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246215 1034 "-\\frac{2x-9}{{(9-2x)}^{2}}" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246215 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533678 true] [17592186246215 1111 #uuid "68b37c79-8edd-52a0-b4c4-33c370ac22f3" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246216 1017 #edb/ref 17592186246217 13194139533678 true] [17592186246216 1089 "q-340287" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246216 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139533678 true] [17592186246216 1100 "Given that $f(x)=\\frac{1}{x+1}$, find ${f}^{′}(x).$\n\n${f}^{′}(x)=$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246216 1113 #uuid "0bcdf15a-4cbd-5e2a-b54c-bb42ecd73867" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246216 1138 false 13194139533678 true] [17592186246216 1145 "The numerator and denominator are $u(x)=1$ and $v(x)=x+1,$ respectively. Their derivatives are given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{u}^{′}(x) & =0, \\\\ {v}^{′}(x) & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nApplying the quotient rule, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{{u}^{′}(x)\\cdot v(x)-u(x)\\cdot {v}^{′}(x)}{[v(x)]^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{0\\cdot (x+1)-1\\cdot 1}{{(x+1)}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{-1}{{(x+1)}^{2}} \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{{(x+1)}^{2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246217 1000 #edb/ref 17592186246218 13194139533678 true] [17592186246217 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139533678 true] [17592186246217 1041 "field-1" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246217 1104 #edb/ref 17592186246218 13194139533678 true] [17592186246217 1110 #uuid "e774d3ca-4f14-5eb4-883a-17e689ce4413" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246218 1034 "-\\frac{1}{(x+1)^2}" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246218 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533678 true] [17592186246218 1111 #uuid "601321da-3a40-5bfa-81e2-b522b0f855f3" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246219 1017 #edb/ref 17592186246220 13194139533678 true] [17592186246219 1089 "q-340297" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246219 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139533678 true] [17592186246219 1100 "Given that $f(x)=\\frac{6x}{1-3x}$, find ${f}^{′}(x).$\n\n${f}^{′}(x)=$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246219 1113 #uuid "3f08699e-4c5f-5296-a9b9-ba2c2100c6eb" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246219 1138 false 13194139533678 true] [17592186246219 1145 "The numerator and denominator are $u(x)=6x$ and $v(x)=1-3x,$ respectively. Their derivatives are given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{u}^{′}(x) & =6, \\\\ {v}^{′}(x) & =-3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nApplying the quotient rule, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{{u}^{′}(x)\\cdot v(x)-u(x)\\cdot {v}^{′}(x)}{[v(x)]^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{6\\cdot (1-3x)-6x\\cdot (-3)}{{(1-3x)}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{6-18x+18x}{{(1-3x)}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{6}{{(1-3x)}^{2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246220 1000 #edb/ref 17592186246221 13194139533678 true] [17592186246220 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139533678 true] [17592186246220 1041 "field-1" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246220 1104 #edb/ref 17592186246221 13194139533678 true] [17592186246220 1110 #uuid "a4b5cddb-528f-552c-82be-44035079905f" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246221 1034 "\\frac{6}{(1-3x)^2}" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246221 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533678 true] [17592186246221 1111 #uuid "a9051a2d-03b5-549f-aea7-978baaf6b1c5" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246222 1017 #edb/ref 17592186246223 13194139533678 true] [17592186246222 1089 "q-340298" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246222 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139533678 true] [17592186246222 1100 "Given that $f(x)=\\frac{{x}^{2}}{x+1}$, find ${f}^{′}(x).$\n\n${f}^{′}(x)=$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246222 1113 #uuid "ae6cc89e-3642-55c0-b50e-0e24c18e5309" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246222 1138 false 13194139533678 true] [17592186246222 1145 "The numerator and denominator are $u(x)={x}^{2}$ and $v(x)=x+1,$ respectively. Their derivatives are given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{u}^{′}(x) & =2x, \\\\ {v}^{′}(x) & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nApplying the quotient rule, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{{u}^{′}(x)\\cdot v(x)-u(x)\\cdot {v}^{′}(x)}{[v(x)]^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{2x\\cdot (x+1)-{x}^{2}\\cdot 1}{{(x+1)}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{2{x}^{2}+2x-{x}^{2}}{{(x+1)}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{{x}^{2}+2x}{(x+1)^{2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246223 1000 #edb/ref 17592186246224 13194139533678 true] [17592186246223 1000 #edb/ref 17592186246225 13194139533678 true] [17592186246223 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139533678 true] [17592186246223 1041 "field-1" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246223 1104 #edb/ref 17592186246225 13194139533678 true] [17592186246223 1110 #uuid "720b458f-adf1-54e0-9048-e68146bb3509" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246224 1034 "\\frac{2x}{x+1}" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246224 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533678 true] [17592186246224 1111 #uuid "080dc689-c096-5e77-8c99-239887c9242c" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246225 1034 "\\frac{x^2+2x}{(x+1)^2}" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246225 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533678 true] [17592186246225 1111 #uuid "2e71560a-cc7e-5d82-bc8b-5993bde15a97" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246226 1017 #edb/ref 17592186246227 13194139533678 true] [17592186246226 1089 "q-340303" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246226 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139533678 true] [17592186246226 1100 "Given that $f(x)=\\frac{x}{{x}^{2}+1},$ find ${f}^{′}(x).$\n\n${f}^{′}(x)=$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246226 1113 #uuid "64f15d3a-2a84-55ee-80eb-8a4dd1f8317c" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246226 1138 false 13194139533678 true] [17592186246226 1145 "The numerator and denominator are $u(x)=x$ and $v(x)={x}^{2}+1,$ respectively. Their derivatives are given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{u}^{′}(x) & =1, \\\\ {v}^{′}(x) & =2x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nApplying the quotient rule, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{{u}^{′}(x)\\cdot v(x)-u(x)\\cdot {v}^{′}(x)}{[v(x)]^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1\\cdot ({x}^{2}+1)-x\\cdot (2x)}{{({x}^{2}+1)}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{{x}^{2}+1-2{x}^{2}}{({x}^{2}+1)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1-{x}^{2}}{({x}^{2}+1)^{2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246227 1000 #edb/ref 17592186246228 13194139533678 true] [17592186246227 1000 #edb/ref 17592186246229 13194139533678 true] [17592186246227 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139533678 true] [17592186246227 1041 "field-1" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246227 1104 #edb/ref 17592186246228 13194139533678 true] [17592186246227 1110 #uuid "8e7c09fa-adca-5a81-8803-6a3873fc9709" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246228 1034 "\\frac{1-x^2}{(x^2+1)^2}" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246228 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533678 true] [17592186246228 1111 #uuid "89254210-8e05-5c05-ae2b-cdca4f61c592" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246229 1034 "\\frac{1}{x^2+1}" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246229 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533678 true] [17592186246229 1111 #uuid "001ae8db-408b-58b4-8d07-c5025e8f84e5" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246230 1017 #edb/ref 17592186246231 13194139533678 true] [17592186246230 1089 "q-340308" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246230 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139533678 true] [17592186246230 1100 "If $f(x)=\\frac{tan⁡x}{x}$,  find ${f}^{′}(x).$\n\n${f}^{′}(x)=$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246230 1113 #uuid "1ce97359-41b2-51ab-b4a2-db452de08f23" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246230 1138 false 13194139533678 true] [17592186246230 1145 "In this case, the expression for $f(x)$ is a quotient $\\frac{u(x)}{v(x)}$ with $u(x)=tan⁡x$ and $v(x)=x.$ \n\nTherefore, we apply the quotient rule as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{{u}^{′}(x)\\cdot v(x)-u(x)\\cdot {v}^{′}(x)}{[v(x)]^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{(tan⁡x)^{′}\\cdot x-tan⁡x\\cdot (x)^{′}}{{x}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{{sec}^{2}⁡x\\cdot x-tan⁡x\\cdot 1}{{x}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{x{sec}^{2}⁡x-tan⁡x}{{x}^{2}}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246231 1000 #edb/ref 17592186246232 13194139533678 true] [17592186246231 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139533678 true] [17592186246231 1041 "field-1" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246231 1104 #edb/ref 17592186246232 13194139533678 true] [17592186246231 1110 #uuid "c6f889ba-dc51-5ba8-9916-8b2ae700bc74" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246232 1034 "\\frac{x\\sec(x)^2-\\tan(x)}{x^2}" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246232 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533678 true] [17592186246232 1111 #uuid "76998902-5504-5745-abfe-25d842c80a30" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246233 1017 #edb/ref 17592186246234 13194139533678 true] [17592186246233 1089 "q-340309" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246233 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139533678 true] [17592186246233 1100 "If $f(x)=\\frac{x}{sin⁡x},$ find ${f}^{′}(x).$\n\n${f}^{′}(x)=$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246233 1113 #uuid "9fc10846-a912-5134-aaff-be58e15672f8" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246233 1138 false 13194139533678 true] [17592186246233 1145 "In this case, the expression for $f(x)$ is a quotient $\\frac{u(x)}{v(x)}$ with $u(x)=x$ and $v(x)=sin⁡x.$ \n\nTherefore, we apply the quotient rule as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{{u}^{′}(x)\\cdot v(x)-u(x)\\cdot {v}^{′}(x)}{[v(x)]^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{(x)^{′}\\cdot sin⁡x-x\\cdot (sin⁡x)^{′}}{{(sin⁡x)}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1\\cdot sin⁡x-x\\cdot cos⁡x}{{sin}^{2}⁡x} \\\\  & =\\frac{sin⁡x-xcos⁡x}{{sin}^{2}⁡x}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246234 1000 #edb/ref 17592186246235 13194139533678 true] [17592186246234 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139533678 true] [17592186246234 1041 "field-1" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246234 1104 #edb/ref 17592186246235 13194139533678 true] [17592186246234 1110 #uuid "728a2b30-c023-566d-b973-d9147ac73629" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246235 1034 "\\frac{\\sin(x)-x\\cos(x)}{\\sin(x)^2}" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246235 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533678 true] [17592186246235 1111 #uuid "588a6e18-a9a2-5e4e-ab09-adea34a83484" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246236 1017 #edb/ref 17592186246237 13194139533678 true] [17592186246236 1089 "q-340316" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246236 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139533678 true] [17592186246236 1100 "If a curve $C$ is given by $y=\\frac{{2}^{x}}{{x}^{2}-1},$ calculate the slope of the tangent line to the curve at the point where $x=0.$\n\nThe slope at $x=0$ is\n{{field-1}}." 13194139533678 true] [17592186246236 1113 #uuid "afab7cbd-9bae-59cf-85a9-207cce57fc21" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246236 1138 false 13194139533678 true] [17592186246236 1145 "In this case, the expression for $y$ is a quotient $\\frac{u(x)}{v(x)}$ with $u(x)={2}^{x}$ and $v(x)={x}^{2}-1.$ \n\nTherefore, we apply the quotient rule as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{{u}^{′}(x)\\cdot v(x)-u(x)\\cdot {v}^{′}(x)}{[v(x)]^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{{({2}^{x})}^{′}\\cdot ({x}^{2}-1)-{2}^{x}\\cdot {({x}^{2}-1)}^{′}}{{({x}^{2}-1)}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{{2}^{x}ln⁡2\\cdot ({x}^{2}-1)-{2}^{x}\\cdot 2x}{{({x}^{2}-1)}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{{2}^{x}[({x}^{2}-1)ln⁡2-2x]}{{({x}^{2}-1)}^{2}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo find the slope of the tangent line, we now substitute $x=0$ into the formula and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}\\,(0) & =\\frac{{2}^{0}[({0}^{2}-1)ln⁡2-2(0)]}{{({0}^{2}-1)}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{-ln⁡2}{1} \\\\  & =-ln⁡2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the slope of the tangent line at $x=0$ is $-ln⁡2.$" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246237 1000 #edb/ref 17592186246238 13194139533678 true] [17592186246237 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139533678 true] [17592186246237 1041 "field-1" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246237 1104 #edb/ref 17592186246238 13194139533678 true] [17592186246237 1110 #uuid "4382508f-68f9-5023-94d1-233e6dcfa872" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246238 1034 "-\\ln(2)" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246238 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533678 true] [17592186246238 1111 #uuid "768adcc3-f732-59bc-bda9-c8863e9b9b80" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246239 1017 #edb/ref 17592186246240 13194139533678 true] [17592186246239 1089 "q-340335" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246239 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139533678 true] [17592186246239 1100 "Given that $f(x)=\\frac{1-sin⁡x}{sin⁡x},$ find ${f}^{′}(x).$\n\n$\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246239 1113 #uuid "1cdddbf1-a23e-50b9-8eb0-6097e93882fd" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246239 1138 false 13194139533678 true] [17592186246239 1145 "Let $u=1-sin⁡x$ and $v=sin⁡x.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=-cos⁡x\\,\\text{and}\\,\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=cos⁡x.\n$$\n\nUsing the quotient rule, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{v\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}-u\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}}{{v}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{sin⁡x\\cdot (-cos⁡x)-(1-sin⁡x)\\cdot cos⁡x}{{sin}^{2}⁡x} \\\\  & =\\frac{cos⁡x(-sin⁡x-1+sin⁡x)}{{sin}^{2}⁡x} \\\\  & =\\frac{cos⁡x\\cdot (-1)}{{sin}^{2}⁡x} \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{sin⁡x}\\cdot \\frac{cos⁡x}{sin⁡x} \\\\  & =-csc⁡xcot⁡x.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246240 1000 #edb/ref 17592186246241 13194139533678 true] [17592186246240 1000 #edb/ref 17592186246242 13194139533678 true] [17592186246240 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139533678 true] [17592186246240 1041 "field-1" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246240 1104 #edb/ref 17592186246242 13194139533678 true] [17592186246240 1110 #uuid "d00bb913-447e-5cd9-bd35-91573e4e5f72" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246241 1034 "\\frac{\\cos(x)}{\\sin(x)^2}" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246241 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533678 true] [17592186246241 1111 #uuid "dfe30e67-9c31-5a51-a83f-61c585e66ee0" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246242 1034 "-\\frac{\\cos(x)}{\\sin(x)^2}" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246242 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533678 true] [17592186246242 1111 #uuid "4b6b30aa-fe0e-5907-9d05-5f17605cf904" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246243 1017 #edb/ref 17592186246244 13194139533678 true] [17592186246243 1089 "q-340337" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246243 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139533678 true] [17592186246243 1100 "Given that $y=\\frac{x}{cos⁡x}$, find $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}.$\n\n$\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{{cos}^{2}⁡x}\\cdot ($\n{{field-1}}\n$).$" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246243 1113 #uuid "43e2e3a5-2c50-5c01-a796-32399b007fa6" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246243 1138 false 13194139533678 true] [17592186246243 1145 "Let $u=x$ and $v=cos⁡x.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x} & =1\\,\\text{and}\\,\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=-sin⁡x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the quotient rule, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{v\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}-u\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}}{{v}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{cos⁡x\\cdot 1-x\\cdot (-sin⁡x)}{{cos}^{2}⁡x} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{{cos}^{2}⁡x}\\cdot (cos⁡x+xsin⁡x\\,).\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246244 1000 #edb/ref 17592186246245 13194139533678 true] [17592186246244 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139533678 true] [17592186246244 1041 "field-1" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246244 1104 #edb/ref 17592186246245 13194139533678 true] [17592186246244 1110 #uuid "e8e5d521-168d-526f-bc55-5f8d602524b5" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246245 1034 "\\cos(x)+x\\sin(x)" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246245 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533678 true] [17592186246245 1111 #uuid "afe1f179-2405-5330-ad28-9f29d774034b" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246246 1017 #edb/ref 17592186246247 13194139533678 true] [17592186246246 1089 "q-340341" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246246 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139533678 true] [17592186246246 1100 "Given that $y=\\frac{x}{ln⁡x},$ find $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}.$\n\n$\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246246 1113 #uuid "4c8059f5-503e-549a-9404-bd9ae05e2ff6" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246246 1138 false 13194139533678 true] [17592186246246 1145 "Let $u=x$ and $v=ln⁡x.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x} & =1\\,\\text{and}\\,\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the quotient rule, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{v\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}-u\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}}{{v}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{(ln⁡x\\cdot 1-x\\cdot \\frac{1}{x})}{{(ln⁡x)}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{ln⁡x-1}{{(ln⁡x)}^{2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246247 1000 #edb/ref 17592186246248 13194139533678 true] [17592186246247 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139533678 true] [17592186246247 1041 "field-1" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246247 1104 #edb/ref 17592186246248 13194139533678 true] [17592186246247 1110 #uuid "6c781990-7027-54c9-b818-28466abc5ee3" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246248 1034 "\\frac{\\ln(x)-1}{\\ln(x)^2}" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246248 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533678 true] [17592186246248 1111 #uuid "5a379761-86e2-5f1a-97da-17f466878f47" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246249 1017 #edb/ref 17592186246250 13194139533678 true] [17592186246249 1089 "q-340343" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246249 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139533678 true] [17592186246249 1100 "Given that $y=\\frac{{log}_{3}⁡x}{{x}^{2}},$ find $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}.$\n\n$\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=($\n{{field-1}}\n$)\\cdot \\frac{1}{{x}^{3}ln⁡3}$" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246249 1113 #uuid "8b8638ce-6889-5b10-aea1-264e085666e2" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246249 1138 false 13194139533678 true] [17592186246249 1145 "Let $u={log}_{3}⁡x=\\frac{ln⁡x}{ln⁡3}$ and $v={x}^{2}.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{1}{xln⁡3}\\,\\text{and}\\,\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=2x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the quotient rule, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{v\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}-u\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}}{{v}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{({x}^{2}\\cdot \\frac{1}{xln⁡3}-\\frac{ln⁡x}{ln⁡3}\\cdot 2x)}{({x}^{2})^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{(\\frac{x}{ln⁡3}-\\frac{2xln⁡x}{ln⁡3})}{{x}^{4}} \\\\  & =\\frac{x-2xln⁡x}{{x}^{4}ln⁡3} \\\\  & =\\frac{x(1-2ln⁡x)}{{x}^{4}ln⁡3} \\\\  & =\\frac{1-2ln⁡x}{{x}^{3}ln⁡3} \\\\  & =(\\,1-2ln⁡x\\,)\\cdot \\frac{1}{{x}^{3}ln⁡3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246250 1000 #edb/ref 17592186246251 13194139533678 true] [17592186246250 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139533678 true] [17592186246250 1041 "field-1" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246250 1104 #edb/ref 17592186246251 13194139533678 true] [17592186246250 1110 #uuid "cd7d34c3-8951-5cd6-b475-ee4fdf33fdbb" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246251 1034 "1-2\\ln(x)" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246251 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533678 true] [17592186246251 1111 #uuid "637d2285-4874-5e27-ad86-48379b35db1b" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246252 1017 #edb/ref 17592186246253 13194139533678 true] [17592186246252 1089 "q-47998" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246252 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139533678 true] [17592186246252 1100 "If $f(x)=\\frac{sin⁡x}{{x}^{2}},$ find ${f}^{′}(x).$" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246252 1113 #uuid "39cf9785-7156-54b5-b18c-4b20a6f8312d" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246252 1138 false 13194139533678 true] [17592186246252 1145 "In this case, the expression for $f(x)$ is a quotient $\\frac{u(x)}{v(x)}$ with $u(x)=sin⁡x$ and $v(x)={x}^{2}.$ \n\nTherefore, we apply the quotient rule as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{{u}^{′}(x)\\cdot v(x)-u(x)\\cdot {v}^{′}(x)}{[v(x)]^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{(sin⁡x)^{′}\\cdot {x}^{2}-sin⁡x\\cdot ({x}^{2})^{′}}{({x}^{2})^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{{x}^{2}cos⁡x-2xsin⁡x}{{x}^{4}} \\\\  & =\\frac{x(xcos⁡x-2sin⁡x)}{{x}^{4}} \\\\  & =\\frac{xcos⁡x-2sin⁡x}{{x}^{3}}\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246253 1000 #edb/ref 17592186246254 13194139533678 true] [17592186246253 1000 #edb/ref 17592186246255 13194139533678 true] [17592186246253 1000 #edb/ref 17592186246256 13194139533678 true] [17592186246253 1000 #edb/ref 17592186246257 13194139533678 true] [17592186246253 1000 #edb/ref 17592186246258 13194139533678 true] [17592186246253 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533678 true] [17592186246253 1041 "selection" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246253 1104 #edb/ref 17592186246254 13194139533678 true] [17592186246253 1110 #uuid "6fddd2bb-2483-5641-a797-6e8fb2801285" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246254 1034 "\\frac{xcos⁡x-2sin⁡x}{{x}^{3}}" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246254 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533678 true] [17592186246254 1111 #uuid "8ae63e1b-8b68-5c03-a6f0-c4212a527ce8" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246255 1034 "\\frac{2xcos⁡x-xsin⁡x}{{x}^{3}}" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246255 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533678 true] [17592186246255 1111 #uuid "f2360488-1c3d-5736-8e6f-103d14970afc" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246256 1034 "\\frac{xcos⁡x+2sin⁡x}{{x}^{3}}" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246256 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533678 true] [17592186246256 1111 #uuid "67458985-f753-505f-b605-28b92746757c" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246257 1034 "\\frac{cos⁡x-2xsin⁡x}{{x}^{4}}" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246257 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533678 true] [17592186246257 1111 #uuid "7908d653-6db4-5ecf-90ae-60d2aa0791c3" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246258 1034 "\\frac{xsin⁡x-2cos⁡x}{{x}^{4}}" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246258 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533678 true] [17592186246258 1111 #uuid "eb8559b5-7421-5652-9381-d4ac81b25c26" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246259 1017 #edb/ref 17592186246260 13194139533678 true] [17592186246259 1089 "q-48504" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246259 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139533678 true] [17592186246259 1100 "If a curve $C$ is given by $y=\\frac{{x}^{2}}{ln⁡(x)},$ calculate the slope of the tangent line to the curve at the point where $x=e.$" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246259 1113 #uuid "aab620f7-092f-5876-b6a6-8f264baccc17" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246259 1138 false 13194139533678 true] [17592186246259 1145 "In this case, the expression for $y$ is a quotient $\\frac{u(x)}{v(x)}$ with $u(x)={x}^{2}$ and $v(x)=ln⁡x.$ \n\nTherefore, we apply the quotient rule as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{{u}^{′}(x)\\cdot v(x)-u(x)\\cdot {v}^{′}(x)}{[v(x)]^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{({x}^{2})^{′}\\cdot ln⁡x-{x}^{2}\\cdot (ln⁡x)^{′}}{(ln⁡x)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{2x\\cdot ln⁡(x)-{x}^{2}\\cdot (\\frac{1}{x})}{{(ln⁡(x))}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{2x\\cdot ln⁡(x)-x}{{ln}^{2}⁡(x)} \\\\  & =\\frac{x(2ln⁡(x)-1)}{{ln}^{2}⁡(x)}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo find the slope of the tangent line, we now substitute $x=e$ into the formula and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(e) & =\\frac{e(2ln⁡(e)-1)}{{ln}^{2}⁡(e)} \\\\  & =\\frac{e(2-1)}{{1}^{2}} \\\\  & =e.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the slope of the tangent line is $e.$" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246260 1000 #edb/ref 17592186246261 13194139533678 true] [17592186246260 1000 #edb/ref 17592186246262 13194139533678 true] [17592186246260 1000 #edb/ref 17592186246263 13194139533678 true] [17592186246260 1000 #edb/ref 17592186246264 13194139533678 true] [17592186246260 1000 #edb/ref 17592186246265 13194139533678 true] [17592186246260 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533678 true] [17592186246260 1041 "selection" 13194139533678 true] [17592186246260 1104 #edb/ref 17592186246263 13194139533678 true] [17592186246260 1110 